*****************************************************************               Macros used by the DISK][ driver**               Oct 10, 1987 10:10**************************************************************** MACRO&lab _setheartbeat** Stack input for SetHeartBeat is as follows:**               longword   Pointer to task header*           sp->*&lab ldx #$1203 jsl $E10000 MEND MACRO&lab _delheartbeat** Stack input for DelHeartBeat is as follows:**               longword   Pointer to task header*           sp->*&lab ldx #$1303 jsl $E10000 MEND MACRO&lab _intsource** Stack input for IntSource is as follows:**               Word       Reference Number*           sp->*&lab ldx #$2303 jsl $E10000 MEND MACRO&lab _longdivide** Stack input for LongDivide is as follows:**               word    space for remainder result*               word    space for quotient result*               long    Numerator*               long    Denominator*           sp->*&lab ldx #$0D0B jsl $E10000 MEND